{"product_id":"iqos-terea-tidal-pearl","title":"IQOS Terea Tidal Pearl","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover Terea Tidal Pearl, a sophisticated edition from the Terea range for the IQOS Iluma system. This stick offers a harmonious blend of sweet, woody, and floral notes, designed for a refined, smoke-free tobacco experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePerfect for lovers of delicate tastes, Tidal Pearl offers a subtle balance, ideal for everyday use or for varying the pleasures.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility note: TEREA sticks are designed to be used only with IQOS ILUMA devices and are not compatible with blade-based IQOS models (including IQOS 3 DUO and earlier). This product contains nicotine, which is addictive, and is strictly 18+ only. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":42079680823351,"sku":"Terea Tidal Pearl - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":42079680856119,"sku":"Terea Tidal Pearl - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-Terea-Tidal-Pearl.webp?v=1769149071","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/iqos-terea-tidal-pearl","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




